# .env.example — committed reference template.
# Copy to .env.local (gitignored), fill in, and let scripts/load-tauri-signing-env.sh
# pick it up. See SIGNING.md for the full key-generation + rotation flow.
#
# Two variables are required for the Tauri auto-updater sidecar signing step
# (the `.dmg`/`.tar.gz` → `.sig` sidecar). Without TAURI_SIGNING_PRIVATE_KEY
# set, `bun run gui:build` exits non-zero even when the `.app` itself was built.
#   https://v2.tauri.app/plugin/updater/#signing

# ─── TAURI_SIGNING_PRIVATE_KEY ───
#
# WARNING: do NOT paste a multi-line minisign blob here directly. bash treats
# every non-comment line as a statement, so a multi-line paste silently tries
# to execute `RWxxxx=yyyyy` as a command and the variable ends up empty.
#
# Preferred — key stays on disk, OS file permissions protect it, no bytes in env:
#   TAURI_SIGNING_PRIVATE_KEY=file://$HOME/.tauri/pure.key
#   # or any absolute path:
#   # TAURI_SIGNING_PRIVATE_KEY=file:///path/to/pure.key
#
# Alternative — embed the literal file contents:
#   TAURI_SIGNING_PRIVATE_KEY="$(cat ~/.tauri/pure.key)"
#
# Generate the key once with:
#   npx tauri signer generate -w ~/.tauri/pure.key      # encrypted; password below
#   npx tauri signer generate                           # unencrypted

# ─── TAURI_SIGNING_PRIVATE_KEY_PASSWORD ───
# Required ONLY if the key was generated with `-w <password>`. Leave empty (or
# omit entirely) for unencrypted keys.
# TAURI_SIGNING_PRIVATE_KEY_PASSWORD=

# ─── Web 搜索 / 抓取 Key(全部可选)───
# 不配置任何 key 也能通过免费后端工作;配置的多个后端按"第一个出结果者胜"降级,
# 失败/被限流的后端进入短暂冷却而不是反复重试。
#
# SERPER_API_KEY       Google SERP 后端(中英文索引最好),~2500 次免费试用
# TAVILY_API_KEY       Tavily 搜索后端,1000 次/月
# EXA_API_KEY          Exa 神经搜索后端,开户 $20 + 每月 $10 循环
# SEARXNG_URL          内网/自建 SearXNG 实例地址(需开启 JSON 格式),公司内网等
#                      公共引擎不可达时的标准解法;留空则跳过
# PURE_JINA_API_KEY    web_scrape/web_fetch 的 Jina Reader 兜底(r.jina.ai),
#                      免 key 可用,带 key 提高限额
# FIRECRAWL_API_KEY    web_scrape/web_fetch 的 Firecrawl 兜底(最难反爬/JS 重页面),
#                      可选
# PURE_LOCATION        天气查询缺城市时的默认城市(如 北京)
#
# 缓存:web_search 15 分钟、web_public_api 按类别、web_scrape/web_fetch 1 小时,
# 统一读写 ~/.pure/cache/web-cache.json(CLI 与 GUI 共享)。
# PURE_WEB_CACHE=off   关闭缓存
# PURE_CACHE_DIR=<dir> 覆盖缓存目录(默认 ~/.pure)
#
# SERPER_API_KEY=
# TAVILY_API_KEY=
# EXA_API_KEY=
# SEARXNG_URL=
# PURE_JINA_API_KEY=
# FIRECRAWL_API_KEY=
# PURE_LOCATION=
